<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex says April natgas output rises.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex says April natgas output rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state-owned oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) said Tuesday that its average April natural gas production was 4.398 billion cubic feet per day (CFD) compared to 4.285 billion CFD in the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287903))</p>
